{
  "id": 8834378662087,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Ball Below Net Blanket with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-ball-below-net-blanket-with-name-and-number-86aaeebf75-86aaeebf75",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in game-day warmth with this custom basketball throw blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for basketball lovers, players, and sports fans, this personalized blanket features a dynamic sports design and can be customized with your chosen name and number for a truly unique gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this sports blanket with your own name and player number for a custom, personalized touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>F factual Composition:</strong> Features a high-confidence sports design showcasing a basketball hoop with a ball below the net on a stylish background.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Materials:</strong> Crafted using two polyester fabric layers, available in both ultra-soft Fleece and plush Sherpa options.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong> Select the perfect fit for your needs from four available sizes: Small (40x30 in), Medium (50x40 in), Large (60x50 in), and X-Large (80x60 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for cuddling up on the sofa or bed while watching your favorite games, lounging, traveling, or using outdoors for camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simple maintenance, machine washable in cold water separately, and quick to air dry to keep it fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Fleece/Sherpa</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Basketball, Game</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Custom Name and Custom Number</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30\"), Medium (50x40\"), Large (60x50\"), X-Large (80x60\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter / All Seasons</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
